    "H1-A1": "A single bounded investigator with explicit component semantics, production topology, structured causal output, and auditable investigation telemetry will improve causal exploration and causal evidence acquisition over v0.2.0 while preserving evidence authority and zero-write safety.",
    "H0-A1": "These representation, context, and protocol improvements do not materially improve causal investigation over the frozen v0.2.0 single-agent baseline.",
    "A2_conditional": "If A1 exposes remaining synthesis or unsupported-attribution failures, one bounded independent Critic may improve final causal diagnosis over A1."
